{"message":"For a personal checking account, I recommend the Bluest Account for your trip. It charges $0 in Rho-Bank foreign ATM fees and automatically rebates third-party foreign ATM operator fees up to $50 per monthly statement cycle. Its daily ATM withdrawal limit is $1,500.

Other $0-Rho-fee alternatives are Purple ($30/month operator-fee rebate cap; $15 monthly maintenance fee, waived with a $3,750 minimum daily balance) and Green Fee-Free ($22.50 monthly maintenance fee, waived with a $150 minimum daily balance; $500 daily ATM limit). Bluest’s monthly maintenance fee was not included in the available account details, so confirm that cost before opening.

The rebate limits matter during a three-month trip: operator fees above the monthly cap are your responsibility, and any ATM currency-conversion charges may also apply. When abroad, choose to be charged in the local currency rather than accepting the ATM’s currency conversion. I have not opened an account."}

